        dcterms:description "Reference JSON pins SHA-256 of 5 dataset files verified fail-closed at import (`load_reference`, L114-L122), Commons licence/author/rendition metadata, IA leaf indices for Figs. 321-322 and p. 634, DOIs for Kiladze 2018 (with PMC id and vendored Table 1 CSV), Kingsley 1988, Raup 1966 and the St Venant 1856 memoir; result.json records every digest, library version and run parameter." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
